        "text": "Better take this along, Don. It's going to be cold on the farm."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 981,
        "text": "Only my mind wasn't on the suitcase, and it wasn't on the weekend. It wasn't on the shirts I was putting in, either. My mind was hanging outside the window. It was suspended about eighteen inches below the sill..."
      }
